    "en": {
      "trackName": "Safe Cracker - Watch Game",
      "description": "Safe Cracker is an exciting puzzle game designed specifically for the Apple Watch. In this game, you play as a skilled safe cracker, trying to crack the combination of a safe using the Watch's Digital Crown.\n\nThe gameplay involves rotating the Digital Crown to dial in the correct numbers of the safe combination. With each attempt, the game provides feedback on whether you are getting closer to the correct combination or not.\n\nWhat sets Safe Cracker apart is its accessibility features that make it enjoyable for visually impaired players. The game uses VoiceOver to provide spoken feedback for every dial movement and combination attempt, ensuring that everyone can participate in the fun.\n\nPut your safe-cracking skills to the test with Safe Cracker, a game that is challenging, engaging, and accessible to all.",
      "releaseNotes": "New modern design for watchOS 26 Liquid Glass including the option to choose between two layouts.",
